Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(cli): drive the help test from one shared lane list

HELP_LANES pairs each help-bearing subcommand with its usage text;
command_usage reads it and the test walks it, deriving flags from the
usage text. A second test fails when a listed COMMAND lacks a lane.

Refs #1296

